{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-28T04:54:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1960928835173802315"],"id":"1960928835173802315","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":85799,"like_count":152,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":1},"text":"来机场接发小，必须要让他感受到东京热 情 https://t.co/3TfSR5e75i","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1960928835173802315"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-27T08:38:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1960623053517562350"],"id":"1960623053517562350","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":51,"impression_count":200327,"like_count":93,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":4},"text":"加高级会员频道先看置顶导航，一些常用的玩法我都整理出来了。\n还有很多没整理在导航里的内容需要你慢慢看。\n有些店铺推荐也没在导航里展示，\n基本看完谁都是日本风俗匠人了🙂 https://t.co/6qTnUAJQhP","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1960623053517562350"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-26T05:01:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1960205868580098513"],"id":"1960205868580098513","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":67785,"like_count":110,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":4},"text":"话说你们去风俗的时候喜欢女孩子主动还是被动的？\n昨天跟个ドS的朋友聊天，\n他说他喜欢去那种女生主动的，\n最好还是那种一上来就搞自己的那种。\n我说你不是S吗？不是应该主动吗？\n他说都去风俗了肯定喜欢服务自己的…\n所以你们喜欢开发还是被调？","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1960205868580098513"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-24T06:21:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1959501280532914355"],"id":"1959501280532914355","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":113051,"like_count":184,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我好像介绍的几家风俗店，全变人气了…\n整得我自己都约不到喜欢的了…🤨","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1959501280532914355"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-23T13:30:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1959246756979384357"],"id":"1959246756979384357","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":51,"impression_count":191957,"like_count":271,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":64,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我是没想到，居然有这么多人对萝莉感兴趣…😳","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1959246756979384357"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-22T04:37:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1958750395947524609"],"id":"1958750395947524609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":444,"impression_count":301773,"like_count":882,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":55,"retweet_count":45},"text":"那天去了新宿一家专门做幼女风女孩子的店，\n里面妹子基本都是140左右的那种，\n进门就穿女儿服或是jc制服，\n抱起来就和抱一个十几岁的小女孩一模一样，\n那种罪恶感简直爆棚，\n我问她多大，她说20，\n我说你这看起来最多12。\n开始服务后问我要不要做全套？\n加两万就可以做全套，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1958750395947524609"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-20T03:03:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1958001993605099718"],"id":"1958001993605099718","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":80181,"like_count":120,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我发现中国人好喜欢挑拨离间，\n天天有人私信我，说不要和这个合作不要和那个合作，\n我是一个做流量的人，\n自然会为了流量不择手段。\n不管合法还是违法，\n世界本身就是由各种有趣的人组成，\n把敏感的人正能量，把正经的人娱乐化，\n这就是中国媒体的流量密码。\n只要人物匹配做好，随手写个剧本也会火的。 https://t.co/Q4CThlIvwO","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1958001993605099718"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-19T10:33:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1957752831009829214"],"id":"1957752831009829214","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":210,"impression_count":203531,"like_count":1259,"quote_count":15,"reply_count":68,"retweet_count":82},"text":"感觉@yuuki_yuduru 还是挺适合拍这种公益视频的，用自己的力量来劝大家，请勿酒后驾车。飲酒運転やめよ https://t.co/3uQGXOJsrX","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1957752831009829214"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-18T10:16:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1957386042212032730"],"id":"1957386042212032730","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":776,"impression_count":1484224,"like_count":3254,"quote_count":29,"reply_count":188,"retweet_count":204},"text":"莫愁前路无知己， https://t.co/A9FlZ8Czip","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1957386042212032730"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-16T03:49:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956563861907316763"],"id":"1956563861907316763","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":100,"impression_count":209692,"like_count":515,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":57,"retweet_count":22},"text":"我是搞不懂为啥那么多人羡慕AV男优，\n本身AV拍出来就是给你看的，\n不是让你幻想参与其中的。\n本身花钱能解决的事情，\n为啥总想着当成自己的一种事业。\n且不说你身体能不能过关，\n就单说面对镜头面对一群人看你你能不能硬起来都是个问题。\n还有些叫嚣着过来拍AV的，\n想无套让他去做个5项体检又不去。 https://t.co/U7q04KFR26","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1956563861907316763"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-15T02:57:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1956188570273898839"],"id":"1956188570273898839","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":110882,"like_count":111,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这帮妹子，体检查出点啥来还在网上公示啊？😳 https://t.co/0zDELuNHzn","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1956188570273898839"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-13T03:35:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955473342171083065"],"id":"1955473342171083065","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":77,"impression_count":165945,"like_count":140,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":6},"text":"最近发现个问题，\n很多加我高级会员频道的人就是单纯想问一下日本风俗哪里好玩，日本风俗该怎么玩，该去哪家店玩。\n有时候人都在酒店了，才想起来加会员，\n巴不得下一秒就来个妹子赶紧到酒店给自己服务，\n对于我写的那些日本风俗玩法的文章根本没时间去仔细阅读。\n为了满足这些没啥耐心，比较着急， https://t.co/FDqyB7oNKr","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1955473342171083065"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-12T10:26:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955214178693812409"],"id":"1955214178693812409","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":89045,"like_count":60,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我自己基本每周要去见四到五个女孩子，\n碰到还可以的就在x上给你们分享一下，\n真的碰到活好身材好颜值高还会玩的，\n我才会给你们在会员频道里推荐。\n只要会员频道里给你们推了，\n基本就无脑冲就行😌 https://t.co/AntJvc2QJg","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1955214178693812409"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-12T02:39:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1955096779168551308"],"id":"1955096779168551308","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":63000,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你们x上一定注意那些主动私信你的账号，\n他们会让你便利店买这种bitcash的百分百骗子，\n不知道这种上古的骗局为啥还有人会相信。\n你们就记得不可能有人主动发私信找你打炮的，就算是🐔也不会。更不用说私下加line了。\n想要找正规的去cityheaven找日本人也会去的店，有些专门接外国人的店铺也需要避雷。 https://t.co/XUEsN2efbO","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1955096779168551308"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-10T03:40:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954387290144510041"],"id":"1954387290144510041","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":68,"impression_count":145706,"like_count":226,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":5},"text":"不要看网站上的价格，\n这帮人有的在自己的介绍页面上有自己的价格…\n尽管你也不知道她为啥值这些🙂 https://t.co/cot6BnqvC4","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1954387290144510041"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-09T03:13:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1954018054733734364"],"id":"1954018054733734364","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":61824,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"几个月前我不是在会员频道里发了外国游客没有日本手机号的情况下怎么预约日本的メンエス嘛，\n那个时候确实只要淘宝买个能收sms的日本号码，就基本可以预约所有的店铺。\n最近不知道是不是放鸽子的太多了，\n日本人这些店铺约好之后，\n需要你给他打电话他才告诉你房间号…\n直接把这条路堵死了😂 https://t.co/0rJtpFYJnj","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1954018054733734364"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-08T08:52:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1953741142736220517"],"id":"1953741142736220517","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":63568,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"真有好的资源我是不可能免费分享的…😌 https://t.co/T6jRmZojzW","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1953741142736220517"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-08T02:34:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1953645917871255843"],"id":"1953645917871255843","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":65,"impression_count":104755,"like_count":177,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":9},"text":"莺谷不是人妻风俗店出名嘛，\n那天看到有家电话NTR的风俗店，\n就是让人妻一边打电话，你在后面一边搞，\n感觉设定还挺有意思，\n就预约一下试试，\n还打算如果有意思就在会员频道里推荐一下。\n结果一进来人就发现这岁数属实有点大，\n甚至她开始打电话的时候，\n会有一种不真实感…\n就给人一种，她都这样了， https://t.co/d45xxgV2ND","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1953645917871255843"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-07T12:35:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1953434798850244817"],"id":"1953434798850244817","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":61255,"like_count":109,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":8},"text":"人和人是需要沟通的，\n当某一句话发现沟通不舒服的时候，\n就应该立刻停止沟通。\n哪怕你耐下心去持续沟通，\n之前的不舒服还是不会让你沟通顺畅的。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1953434798850244817"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-07T03:32:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1953298275341308339"],"id":"1953298275341308339","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":55,"impression_count":103676,"like_count":286,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":4},"text":"前几天接待客户时候去了银座一家店，\n发现现在日本人体宴搞的越来越高级了…😳 https://t.co/PG9dLEH2sX","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1953298275341308339"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-06T03:39:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1952937612311974216"],"id":"1952937612311974216","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":42,"impression_count":160720,"like_count":271,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":5},"text":"来日本想要玩风俗的，\n请避开8月9号～8月17号。\n除非你提前很久已经约过，\n否则那几天你会知道什么叫玩别人玩剩下的…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1952937612311974216"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-05T04:47:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1952592357540663344"],"id":"1952592357540663344","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":78126,"like_count":94,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":3},"text":"哎哟，现在已经有日本风俗店支持btc和eth支付了啊😂😂😂 https://t.co/FR5okB5qtA","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1952592357540663344"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-04T11:37:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1952332979436474431"],"id":"1952332979436474431","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":71669,"like_count":98,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":1},"text":"西川口真的玩的是五花八门的😂 https://t.co/JIdzGlpC1c","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1952332979436474431"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-03T04:48:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1951867738823200887"],"id":"1951867738823200887","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":94491,"like_count":227,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":41,"retweet_count":1},"text":"本来都不想玩国内自媒体了，\n结果发一个视频星图就来了一堆商单。\n接也不是不接也不是，\n国内经纪人一直劝我重新开始做抖音，\n但我总感觉国内自媒体有今天没明天的，\n太不稳定了…😅 https://t.co/WV5PJK4fqa","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1951867738823200887"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-08-02T12:08:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1951616034701766833"],"id":"1951616034701766833","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":47968,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"長岡花火大会 https://t.co/NsYZkFco4x","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1951616034701766833"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"222316578","name":"梁","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772826334999502848/ZdX2uBog_normal.jpg","username":"iam678","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1960928835173802315","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fscb5uqu1be3ntz8st4q0e41rovy4d","oldest_id":"1951616034701766833","result_count":25}}